Subject: Goldfish: a run shorter than T4-T6 names the turns it played

The summary said "made every land drop through T5" and "by T4, T5, T6",
and the report tiles "On-curve through T5" and "4+-spell turn by T6", in
runs shorter than those turns, while metrics.py already judges on-curve
through min(5, until_turn) and 4+-spell turns through min(6, until_turn).
The labels now name min(turn, until_turn), and the commander by-turn
figures past the run's last turn are left out.

